### Known Issues
- `mobile.css` uses blanket `!important` nuclear overrides—any desktop CSS change can break mobile
- `style.css` has mobile `@media` sprinkled at least 8 different places, creating specificity wars
- Insights section is completely hardcoded — no blog engine
- Blog nav link is disabled (`Coming Soon`)
- Several JS modules disabled: `CardTiltEffect`, `MagneticButtons`, `HeroWaterBubble`
- No page transitions / section entry choreography — everything fades in generically
- Contact section and footer are visually plain
- The `extras/` folder has 36 image assets (cinematic, glitch, neon) completely unused

