## Phase 2: God-Tier Animations & Visual Flow (Desktop)

> **Goal**: Transform the scroll experience into a cinematic journey. Each section reveals with choreographed intent—not generic fade-ins.

### 2A. Hero Entrance Sequence

The hero is the first impression. It must be **breathtaking**.

#### Animation Sequence (after preloader fades out):

| Step | Element | Animation | Duration | Delay |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `.hero-orb-1, .hero-orb-2, .hero-orb-3` | Scale from 0, blur in | 1.2s | 0s |
| 2 | `.hero-label` | Typewriter effect (keep existing) | — | 0.3s |
| 3 | `.hero-title` / `.glitch-name` | Slide up from 30px + blur | 0.8s | 0.5s |
| 4 | `.hero-subtitle` | Fade + slide up 20px | 0.6s | 0.8s |
| 5 | `.hero-cta-group` | Scale from 0.9 + fade | 0.5s | 1.0s |
| 6 | `.hero-stats` | Stagger each stat counter (count-up) | 0.4s each | 1.2s |
| 7 | `.hero-profile-card` | Slide from right + gentle 3D rotate | 0.8s | 0.6s |

#### [MODIFY] [app.js](file:///Users/vineetkishore/Documents/iCloud%20Drive/Drive%20X/Softwares/Coding%20Projects/Portfolio%20Project/core/js/app.js)
- Create a `HeroEntranceTimeline` using `gsap.timeline()` that orchestrates all of the above
- Replace existing individual `gsap.from(...)` calls (lines ~410–456) with this unified timeline
- Add a **number count-up animation** for hero stats (5K+, 91st, 99.9%) — animate from 0 to target value

### 2B. Section Scroll Choreography

Replace the generic `SectionReveals.init()` (lines 1549–1590) with a **per-section custom choreography system**:

#### About Section
- Section header fades in, then kinetic text slides in from right
- 4 about-cards **stagger** in from bottom (0.15s between each)
- Each card has a subtle `clipPath` reveal: `inset(100% 0 0 0)` → `inset(0)`

#### Experience Section
- Vertical timeline line **draws** itself (height 0 → 100%, synced with scroll)
- Timeline dots **pulse** as they activate
- Cards slide in **alternately** from left and right

#### Projects Section
- Cards enter with a **3D perspective tilt** (rotateY from ±15deg → 0)
- On hover: card lifts with elongated shadow + subtle glow border
- Filter transitions: cards scale down to 0.8 → reposition → scale back to 1

#### Skills Section
- Each category **slides in from the left** with staggered timing
- Skill tags inside each category **ripple in** (staggered 0.03s each)

#### Education Section
- Cards **fan in** like dealing playing cards (slight rotation + translate)

#### [MODIFY] [app.js](file:///Users/vineetkishore/Documents/iCloud%20Drive/Drive%20X/Softwares/Coding%20Projects/Portfolio%20Project/core/js/app.js)
- Replace existing generic reveal logic with section-specific GSAP ScrollTrigger timelines
- Use `scrub: 0.5` for parallax-style animations where appropriate
- Keep `start: 'top 85%'` for trigger points

