## Phase 3: Mobile Layout Overhaul

> **Goal**: A pixel-perfect, bug-free mobile experience isolated from desktop CSS.

### 3A. Critical Mobile Fixes

All in [mobile-v2.css](file:///Users/vineetkishore/Documents/iCloud%20Drive/Drive%20X/Softwares/Coding%20Projects/Portfolio%20Project/core/css/mobile-v2.css):

1. **Hero Section** (`≤768px`):
   - `.hero-grid` → single column, hero content first, image below
   - Profile card: `width: 200px; height: 270px;` centered
   - Hero title font: `clamp(1.8rem, 8vw, 2.8rem)`
   - CTA buttons side-by-side (flex-row, equal width)
   - Stats row: horizontal, evenly spaced

2. **Navigation** (`≤1024px`):
   - Hide `.nav-links` — hamburger menu opens full-screen overlay
   - `.nav-cta` (Resume) → hide text, show icon-only
   - Full-screen menu: slide-down panel with large touch-friendly links (48px min touch target)

3. **Cards & Grids** (`≤768px`):
   - `.about-grid`, `.skills-grid`, `.education-grid`, `.insights-grid` → `display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;`
   - `.projects-cinema` → vertical stack with full-width cards
   - Remove all horizontal scroll jank

4. **Timeline** (`≤768px`):
   - Convert to vertical-only layout (no horizontal scroll)
   - Each timeline item full-width, stacked

5. **Bottom Dock**:
   - Cleaner glassmorphism: `background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(30px) saturate(180%);`
   - Proper safe-area inset for iPhone notch: `padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom);`
   - Active indicator animation: dot grows + glow

6. **Contact Grid** (`≤768px`):
   - `grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;` (2×2 grid)
   - On `≤480px` → single column

7. **Global Mobile Rules**:
   - `body { padding-bottom: 100px; }` to clear bottom dock
   - Disable Quantum Firefly cursor: `.quantum-firefly { display: none; }`
   - Disable kinetic text parallax for performance
   - Ensure no horizontal overflow: `html, body { overflow-x: hidden; }`

### 3B. Mobile JS Adjustments

#### [MODIFY] [app.js](file:///Users/vineetkishore/Documents/iCloud%20Drive/Drive%20X/Softwares/Coding%20Projects/Portfolio%20Project/core/js/app.js)
- Gate ALL desktop-only effects behind `window.innerWidth > 1024` or `!('ontouchstart' in window)`:
  - `CardTiltEffect`, `MagneticButtons`, `HeroWaterBubble`, custom cursor
- On mobile, use simpler GSAP animations (shorter durations, no 3D transforms)
- Mobile dock active-state updater (IntersectionObserver) — keep existing, just ensure debouncing

