## Phase 4: Blog Engine (Markdown → Native Pages)

> **Goal**: A fully static blog powered by markdown files in a `blogs/` folder. No backend. Fetches `blogs/index.json` for metadata. Pages look native to the site.

### Architecture

```
portfolio-root/
├── blogs/
│   ├── index.json          ← Manifest of all blog posts (manually maintained or auto-generated)
│   ├── 2026-02-15-building-self-healing-clusters.md
│   ├── 2026-02-10-optimizing-token-usage-rag.md
│   └── 2026-01-28-physics-fluid-interfaces.md
├── blog.html               ← Blog listing page (pagination, sort)
└── blog-post.html          ← Individual blog post reader
```

### 4A. Blog Manifest

