### 4B. Blog Listing Page

#### [NEW] [blog.html](file:///Users/vineetkishore/Documents/iCloud%20Drive/Drive%20X/Softwares/Coding%20Projects/Portfolio%20Project/blog.html)

- Same nav, footer, font stack, and color scheme as `index.html`
- Fetches `blogs/index.json` via `fetch()`
- Renders **10 posts per page** as styled cards
- **Pagination**: Page 1, 2, 3... buttons at the bottom
- **Sort dropdown**: Latest, Oldest, A–Z
- **Category filter** pills (drawn dynamically from manifest categories)
- Uses same design language: dark cards, subtle borders, accent-blue highlights
- Search is done client-side by filtering the already-fetched manifest

### 4C. Blog Post Reader

#### [NEW] [blog-post.html](file:///Users/vineetkishore/Documents/iCloud%20Drive/Drive%20X/Softwares/Coding%20Projects/Portfolio%20Project/blog-post.html)

- Reads `?slug=building-self-healing-clusters` from URL params
- Looks up the post in `blogs/index.json`
- Fetches the corresponding `.md` file
- Parses markdown → HTML using **marked.js** (CDN: `https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/marked/marked.min.js`)
- Renders with **syntax highlighting** via **highlight.js** (CDN)
- Full markdown support: headings, bold, italic, lists, code blocks, tables, images, blockquotes, horizontal rules, links
- Uses same nav/footer as main site
- Styled with a dedicated `.blog-prose` class that ensures:
  - `max-width: 720px` centered reading column
  - `font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8`
  - Proper heading hierarchy (h1–h6 with decreasing sizes + accent colors)
  - Code blocks with dark background, mono font, horizontal scroll for overflow
  - Tables with border styling matching the site
  - Images: `max-width: 100%; border-radius: 12px;`
  - Blockquotes: left accent-blue border + darker background
  - Back button / breadcrumb at top: `← Back to Blog`

